{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20993","headline":"夜坐吟 · 李贺","name":"夜坐吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"踏踏马蹄谁见过，眼看北斗直天河。\n西风罗幕生翠波，铅华笑妾颦青蛾。\n爲君起唱长相思，帘外严霜皆倒飞。\n明星烂烂东方陲，红霞梢出东南涯，陆郎去矣乘班骓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}